:history

    0.6.6-dev - 2026/05/11 (1c1c2a5) [develop]
        :brief Hugging Face / ML-Intern research loop
        - feat(hf): 新增 ML-Intern-inspired HF research loop contracts, 覆盖 docs/papers/datasets/models/spaces/jobs/trackio
        - feat(hf): HF records 可转换为 Source Ledger, HF jobs 可转换为 ExperimentRun 并记录 tool trace
        - feat(capability): Hugging Face capability pack 增加 hf.models、hf.spaces、hf.trackio
        - feat(experiment): experiment loop capability resolution 接入 hf.jobs 与 hf.trackio
        - feat(python): 新增 hf_research_probe bridge, 产品默认未授权网络时 blocked/failed, fixture 仅作为显式测试输入
        - test(hf): 覆盖 HF capability plan、source ledger、job experiment conversion、未授权网络禁止 mock
        :src
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/huggingface-loop.ts - HF research loop contracts, source conversion, job-to-experiment conversion, diagnostics
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/capability-pack.ts - HF models/spaces/trackio capabilities
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/experiment-loop.ts - HF jobs/trackio experiment capability integration
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/run.ts - PaperRun HF diagnostics summary
            - research-tools/src/paper_fucker_tools/huggingface_loop.py - HF Python bridge with explicit fixture/live-only behavior
            - research-tools/src/paper_fucker_tools/mcp_tools.py - hf_research_probe registry entry
        :test
            - packages/opencode/test/paper/huggingface-loop.test.ts - HF research loop contract tests
            - packages/opencode/test/paper/experiment-loop.test.ts - HF experiment capability regression
            - research-tools/tests/test_huggingface_loop.py - Python bridge product no-mock enforcement tests
